
@startuml
title PayLink - Pay a Bill Sequence Diagram

autonumber

actor Customer
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Payment Service" as Payment
participant "Fraud Service" as Fraud
participant "Fee Service" as Fee
participant "Wallet Service" as Wallet
participant "Biller Adapter" as Adapter
participant "External Biller" as Biller
queue "Message Broker" as Broker
participant "Notification Service" as Notification

== Payment Request ==

Customer -> App: Select bill and enter payment details
App -> Gateway: Submit payment request
Gateway -> Payment: Forward request

Payment -> Payment: Check idempotency key

alt Duplicate request
    Payment --> Gateway: Return existing payment status
    Gateway --> App: Existing payment result
else New request

    == Validation ==

    Payment -> Fraud: Validate customer, limits and transaction
    Fraud --> Payment: Validation result

    alt Fraud check fails
        Payment -> Payment: Set status = REJECTED
        Payment --> Gateway: Payment rejected
        Gateway --> App: Display rejection reason

    else Fraud check passes

        == Fee Calculation ==

        Payment -> Fee: Calculate service fee
        Fee --> Payment: Return fee and total amount

        == Wallet Reservation ==

        Payment -> Wallet: Hold total amount
        Wallet -> Wallet: Check available balance

        alt Insufficient balance
            Wallet --> Payment: Hold rejected
            Payment --> Gateway: Insufficient balance
            Gateway --> App: Display insufficient balance

        else Sufficient balance
            Wallet -> Wallet: Reserve funds
            Wallet --> Payment: Hold successful

            == Biller Processing ==

            Payment -> Payment: Set status = PROCESSING
            Payment -> Adapter: Submit payment request
            Adapter -> Biller: Send bill payment

            alt Biller confirms payment
                Biller --> Adapter: Success + biller reference
                Adapter --> Payment: Payment confirmed

                Payment -> Wallet: Capture held amount
                Wallet --> Payment: Funds captured

                Payment -> Payment: Set status = SUCCESS
                Payment -> Broker: Publish PaymentSucceeded event

                Payment --> Gateway: Payment successful
                Gateway --> App: Display confirmation

            else Biller rejects payment
                Biller --> Adapter: Failure + reason
                Adapter --> Payment: Payment rejected

                Payment -> Wallet: Release held amount
                Wallet --> Payment: Funds released

                Payment -> Payment: Set status = FAILED
                Payment -> Broker: Publish PaymentFailed event

                Payment --> Gateway: Payment failed
                Gateway --> App: Display failure reason

            else Biller timeout
                Adapter --> Payment: Timeout / Unknown result

                Payment -> Payment: Set status = UNKNOWN
                Payment --> Gateway: Payment status unknown
                Gateway --> App: Show processing message

                note over Payment, Biller
                  Do not release held funds or retry
                  blindly. Reconcile with the biller
                  using the same idempotency key.
                end note
            end
        end
    end
end

== Asynchronous Notifications ==

Broker -> Notification: Consume payment event
Notification -> Customer: Send SMS / Push notification

@enduml
